  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'genuine-turquoise-teardrop-hoop-earrings-sterling-silver-southwestern-turquoise-', '1544821021', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1544821021/turquoise-teardrop-hoop-earrings?click_key=EuUlOSE-W4_A3Il7jOcu-QwYWWee%3ALT411bc9a54c6b9a0be856657d85d634719802b400&click_sum=fbf5c431&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-969537-15-12&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sca=1&sts=1',
   'Genuine Turquoise Teardrop Hoop Earrings | Sterling Silver | Southwestern Turquoise Earrings | Western Jewelry', 'Genuine turquoise, sterling silver, and a bold teardrop silhouette — these earrings are pure Southwestern statement jewelry. Each earring features genuine turquoise stones individually set around an open teardrop-shaped hoop, creating beautiful color and dimension without the heaviness of a solid earring. The mix of turquoise matrix and natural variation gives each stone its own character, while the sterling silver setting keeps the look classic and easy to wear. These have that unmistakable Western-meets-Southwestern feel Skyhawkranch is known for. Pair them with denim and a white shirt for an everyday Western look, or let them bring a shot of turquoise to a simple black dress. Details: • Genuine turquoise • Sterling silver • Open teardrop hoop design • Individual turquoise stone setting • Natural variations in turquoise color and matrix • Southwestern / Western style • Statement size with an airy open center * Handcrafted and Hallmarked 925 Sterling silver * 2" long by 1.5" wide * 3g a piece (lightweight) * Gift Ready: Packaged in a gift box with the Skyhawk Ranch logo/ See last picture Production partners SkyhawkRanch makes this item with help from A Shop in New Mexico and Phillipines, Albuquerque, NM', 'turquoise-jewelry',
