  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'arizona-turquoise-heishi-necklace-3mm-beads-solid-14k-gold-gold-filled-or-sterli', '1839877656', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1839877656/arizona-turquoise-heishi-necklace-3mm?click_key=EuUlOSE-W4_A3Il7jOcu-QwYWWee%3ALTbaa18df905a18c091f69fee3c53a8e23af9ea197&click_sum=60f618e8&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-969537-15-10&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&sts=1',
   'Arizona Turquoise Heishi Necklace | 3mm Beads | Solid 14k Gold, Gold Filled, or Sterling Silver | Dainty Minimalist Jewelry', 'This gemstone necklace is handcrafted with AAA-grade genuine 3mm Arizona turquoise heishi beads, complemented by your choice of solid 14k gold, gold-filled, or sterling silver spacer beads, findings, and clasp. The Arizona turquoise displays a vibrant blend of blue and green tones with subtle brown matrix, creating a clean, balanced design with unmistakable Southwestern character. Each turquoise heishi bead is individually cut and polished to a smooth, glossy finish, allowing the natural color variations and character of the turquoise to shine through. The slim profile and minimalist design make this necklace easy to wear alone for an understated look or layered with your favorite gemstone, gold, or silver necklaces. Details: Bead Size: 3mm genuine Arizona turquoise heishi beads Color: Shades of blue and green with subtle brown matrix Metal Options: Solid 14k gold, gold-filled, or sterling silver spacer beads, findings, and clasp Necklace Length: Available in 14" to 24" lengths with a 2" extender Packaging: Arrives gift-ready in elegant packaging Lead Time: Ships within 3 business days Shipping: Standard Shipping to U.S. Addresses: USPS First-Class Mail (2–4 business days) Standard Shipping to International Addresses: USPS First-Class International Mail (10–21 business days) Origin & Metaphysical Properties: Arizona turquoise is prized for its vibrant blue and green hues accented by natural brown matrix, making each necklace one of a kind. Mined in the American Southwest, it has been treasured for centuries and is associated with peace, self-confidence, protection, and balance, making it as meaningful as it is timeless.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
