  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'floral-carved-with-natural-turquoise-handcrafted-tibetan-repousse-silver-1-25-x1', '4506606787', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4506606787/floral-carved-with-turquoise-handcrafted?click_key=EuUlOSE-W4_A3Il7jOcu-QwYWWee%3ALT7d366011c5d71841a2e2773b10fabc1ee23cd485&click_sum=75c95e94&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-969537-15-9&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1',
   'Floral carved with natural turquoise, Handcrafted, Tibetan repousse silver, 1.25 x1.25 inches (P-220)', 'This handcrafted floral pendant features a stunning turquoise (composite) centerpiece, expertly set in a silver repoussé frame that showcases intricate detailing and craftsmanship. The combination of vibrant turquoise and the textured silver design creates a unique, elegant piece perfect for adding a touch of artisanal charm to any outfit. Whether worn as a statement or a subtle accent, this pendant embodies the beauty of traditional silversmith techniques and natural gemstone allure. Note: Center piece of turquoise might be different than picture. NOTE: Tibetan silver is not sterling silver', 'turquoise-jewelry',
