   'Turquoise Necklace, 925 Sterling Silver Three Stone Pendant, Blue Turquoise Gemstone Jewelry, Southwestern Boho Necklace, Gift for Her', 'Add timeless elegance to your jewelry collection with this beautiful Natural Turquoise Necklace, crafted in 925 Sterling Silver. Featuring three stunning natural turquoise stones arranged in an elegant pendant design, this necklace showcases beautiful blue-green colors with unique natural matrix patterns. The detailed silver setting gives it a vintage-inspired and Southwestern look, making it a perfect accessory for everyday styling or special occasions. ✨ Product Details Material: 925 Sterling Silver Gemstone: Natural Turquoise Design: Three Stone Gemstone Pendant Color: Blue Turquoise Style: Vintage, Bohemian, Southwestern Necklace: Silver Chain Included Finish: Silver Handmade Jewelry 🎁 Perfect Gift For Birthdays and anniversaries Mother''s Day gifts Christmas and holiday gifts Turquoise jewelry lovers Boho and vintage jewelry lovers Special gifts for her 💎 Why You''ll Love It Every turquoise stone features its own natural color variations and unique patterns, making each piece special. The elegant three-stone arrangement creates a beautiful statement while maintaining a timeless and versatile look. Jewelry Care Instructions Keep away from water, perfumes, and harsh chemicals. Remove before swimming, bathing, or exercising. Store in a dry jewelry box or pouch. Clean gently with a soft, dry polishing cloth. Avoid ultrasonic cleaners for natural turquoise. Bring natural gemstone beauty and sterling silver elegance to your everyday style! STANDARD SHIPPING : Delivery Time: 14-21business days Carrier: International Registered Mail / Standard Postal Service Tracking: Included Notes: Delivery times may vary slightly depending on destination and customs processing. EXPRESS SHIPPING (UPGRADE) Delivery Time: 5-8 business days Carrier: Express Courier Service : FedEx / UPS or similar) Tracking: Full tracking included Notes: Faster an