  (uuid_generate_v4(), '2-styles-navajo-turquoise-layering-set-3-piece-western-beaded-necklaces-adjustab', '4468482856', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4468482856/2-styles-navajo-turquoise-layering-set-3?click_key=EuUlOSE-W4_A3Il7jOcu-QwYWWee%3ALT9239ddbc1ccd73caa4fe4ee77857805a584ab872&click_sum=f9e88cff&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-969537-15-7&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1',
   '2 Styles Navajo Turquoise Layering Set, 3 Piece Western Beaded Necklaces, Adjustable Southwestern Choker Stack, Boho Cowgirl Jewelry', '✨ Timeless Navajo-Inspired Turquoise Layering Set – Embrace Western Elegance ✨ Elevate your jewelry collection with our 3-Piece Navajo Style Turquoise Necklace Set, a stunning homage to Southwestern craftsmanship and boho-cowgirl charm. This versatile trio features vibrant turquoise beads paired with sleek CCB and durable alloy accents, creating a layered look that exudes effortless sophistication. Wear them together for a bold statement, or split them up for three unique everyday styles – the choice is yours! Key Features: Dual Style Options: Choose from two curated designs, each offering a distinct Western aesthetic to match your mood or outfit. Premium Craftsmanship: Hand-strung with natural turquoise beads, smooth CCB, and sturdy alloy hardware, finished with a polished silver-tone clasp for lasting wear. Perfectly Adjustable: Three necklaces with adjustable extenders (38+5cm / 40+10cm / 45+5cm) ensure a customized fit for every neckline. Substantial & Luxe: Weighing 58g total, this set has a satisfying, high-quality feel without being cumbersome for all-day wear. Versatile Western Style: Ideal for pairing with a crisp white linen shirt, a flowy boho dress, or your favorite denim jacket, this set seamlessly transitions from casual brunch dates to desert-inspired events. It’s the ultimate accessory for channeling iconic Southwestern style. Product Details: Set Includes: 3 Necklaces (wear as a set or individually) Total Weight: 58g Materials: Natural Turquoise, CCB, Durable Alloy (silver-tone finish) Lengths: 38+5cm | 40+10cm | 45+5cm (adjustable for layering perfection) Styles: 2 Unique Curated Designs Available Packaging: Comes in a rustic drawstring pouch, perfect for gifting or safekeeping. A Thoughtful Gift: This Navajo-inspired turquoise set makes a heartfelt gift for birthdays, Mother’s Day, or any occasion – perfect for the boho lover, cowgirl enthusiast, or anyone who appreciates timeless Southwestern design.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
