   'Handmade Silver-Plated Brass Gemstone Ring: Adjustable Antique Finish', 'The Classic Carpel Collection of Finger Rings is an exquisite assortment of handcrafted, silver-plated brass rings, each featuring an oxidized finish that evokes the charm of antique silver or aged silver. Inspired by the carpel, the female reproductive system of a flower, these rings symbolize fertility and harness the healing powers of the gemstones they showcase. Designed with an adjustable band, these rings can easily adapt to fit various finger sizes. Each piece is adorned with a captivating cabochon gemstone, such as Black Onyx, Turquoise, Labradorite, Sun Stone, Clear Crystal, Lapis Lazuli, Tiger Eye, Green Onyx, Amethyst, and more, offering a wide selection to choose from. Embrace the beauty and healing properties of the Classic Carpel Collection, as you explore and select the perfect ring that resonates with your style and personal journey. HAND-CRAFTED WITH CARE: Individually hand-crafted with love and care by our master artisans. One of its kind. We take utmost care to create these jewelry pieces with perfection. Since they are purely handmade, they may have slight variations, which is the natural outcome of Human artistry. Every piece is Individually made, So it may not be the same, but surely similar. Product specifications: Width of Ring: 1.95 CM Inner diameter: 1.81 CM Ring By Size chart: US Size: 8 UK Size: Q Euro Size: 57 Adjustable Color: Silver PACKING: Gift Ready with box from Pure Hands Studio! This beautiful piece is securely packed in a gift box packing for safe shipping. Note: If ordering multiple items, I will automatically package them in the same gift box. If you would like to have them packaged in their own individual gift box, then please leave me a note at checkout in "note to seller". ABOUT US: Pure Hands, the Art of Handmade Jewellery: Pure Hands Studio was founded with a rebellious spirit and a lofty objective to offer designer jewelry at excellent prices while leading the way for a socially conscious business. We are a small team of', 'turquoise-jewelry',
