  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'native-choker-with-feathers-and-fire-rosebud-7-strand-earrings-included', '4614594126', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614594126/native-choker-with-feathers-and-fire?click_key=5ea596ef-62a5-4ff0-9bb4-7ad5202a8c34%3ALTca256a2ffe340cb0afa05d7f6c4cdcb18c456cd4&click_sum=588b76b1&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-528338-15-1&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=5ea596ef-62a5-4ff0-9bb4-7ad5202a8c34%253ALTca256a2ffe340cb0afa05d7f6c4cdcb18c456cd4',
   'Native Choker with Feathers and Fire Rosebud, 7-Strand Earrings Included', 'This choker has a lot of matte turquoise, black and red which looks great, but in the center orange, squash, yellow and white enhances the center with a little dance around the center diamond shape. After the center area there are 2 long feathers side by side. Then a fire rosebud has a stem that runs down in between the two feathers and connects up with the center area. After this area is another feather that is larger. It ends with a diamond shape and partial diamond shapes. It is 13 1/4 inches long with a strong extension chain to hook into it needed. It comes with Free 7 strand earrings (a $17.00 value). Two of the strands are long silver arrows and the other 5 strands have feathers and size 8 rocaille beads. The lengths of the strands are staggered to create a V-like look. The strands dangle from a round earring component.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
