  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'turquoise-flower-bolo-necklace-hand-forged-sterling-silver-one-of-a-kind', '4446759908', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4446759908/turquoise-flower-bolo-necklace-hand?click_key=2ed48753-436f-4083-9571-6ba7e17e2d61%3ALT26da03d370c07c20cd0e4b20862b8739dad85e50&click_sum=ad22747b&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-882401-14-38&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=2ed48753-436f-4083-9571-6ba7e17e2d61%253ALT26da03d370c07c20cd0e4b20862b8739dad85e50',
   'Turquoise Flower Bolo Necklace, Hand Forged Sterling Silver, One of a Kind', 'These stunning necklaces feature hand forged sterling silver flowers, cupping gorgeous natural turquoise stones! These bolo necklaces are fully adjustable, which makes them so easy to wear with anything! Wear it short like a choker, long like a pendant, or anywhere in between! Easily adjust the rubber-filled stopper beads on the chain to change where the flower lays. The stones are freeform shapes of authentic Sonoran Turquoise, hand cut and polished by a small family lapidary in Arizona. The flower shapes were hand-sawn from thick 21 gauge solid sterling silver sheet metal and hand stamped with boho designs. The ends of each bolo necklace feature two little sterling silver leaves to finish off the botanical feel to these. The thick Rolo chains are very strong. With the sudden rise in silver prices, in order to make these necklaces both affordable, as well as very durable, I chose to use solid stainless steel for the chain. All other components of the necklace are sterling silver. (Just FYI, I never use any plated, cheap metals in my shop either) The total chain length of Bolo A is 42" and the total chain length of Bolo B is 37" long. The flower focal point of each necklace is approximately 1.5" wide. Please make your necklace selection from the 3rd photo. I only made one of each. Slowly handmade, with Love, in the mountains of California. Your new necklace will arrive gift boxed, ready for gifting or treating yourself. Fast and free shipping on every order!', 'turquoise-jewelry',
